A main-thread command that changes into a subdirectory and then runs the append to the top-level .gitignore of the sandbox repo inside a parenthesized subshell must be DENIED. The subshell hides the write from the outer segment scan, so the guard must look inside the subshell group. This pins the deny that the nested-scan fix in 9db8a72 now gives, so the case is expected to PASS on this commit.
